{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10283090","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10283090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1028309001:1":{"text":"라이카와 로잔이구나. 당분간은 어디 다니지 말고 얌전히 있거라. 마을 분위기가 영 안 좋아...","source_cn":"是你们啊。唉，最近还是别到处乱跑，大伙都人心惶惶的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2032FDF313A1CCCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028309002:1":{"text":"어르신, 안녕하세요. 약용 식물에 관해 물어보고 싶어서 찾아왔어요.","source_cn":"您好，尊敬的长者，我们只是想来问一些和药用植物有关的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC32DFA484973322E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028309003:1":{"text":"악용 식물? 그건 내가 잘 알지. 이 꽃차들도 다 내가 만든 거란다. 비밀 레시피지.","source_cn":"药用植物？这你们可问对人了。这些花茶都是我亲自采摘配制...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F66F06ABF922E32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028309004:0":{"text":"한 잔 어떤가?","source_cn":"你们要不要来一杯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF760917985CB9663","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028309005:1":{"text":"네, 너무 좋아요! 호록...\n와아! 우와아!","source_cn":"好啊好啊！让我试试……\\n哇哦！哇哦哇哦哇哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F50EB4CD972F65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1028309005":{"text":"네, 너무 좋아요! 호록...\n와아! 우와아!","source_cn":"好啊好啊！让我试试……\\n哇哦！哇哦哇哦哇哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F50EB4CD972F65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028309006:1":{"text":"정말 맛있어요! 한 잔만 먹었는데 영혼이 하늘로 날아갈 것만 같아요! 어렸을 때로 돌아간 것처럼 너무 즐거워요!","source_cn":"真——香啊！这么一杯下去，感觉我的灵魂都要飞上天，像是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E0E79006F899363","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028309007:1":{"text":"세상에! 어르신, 이 차를 마시면 어렸을 때로 돌아가거나 그러는 건 아니죠?! 너무 신기해요!","source_cn":"天啊，老人家，你这茶不会能让人返老还童吧？！太神奇了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC36C6714A43FD8E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028309008:1":{"text":"하하, 칭찬 고맙네. 자네 말처럼 젊어질 수 있다면, 내가 왜 아직 이 모습 그대로 있겠는가?","source_cn":"哈哈，多谢你的称赞，要真能像你说的那样，我怎么还会是现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05CB42ED777F558D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028309009:1":{"text":"그래, 그래서 물어보려는 “약용 식물”이 어떤 거지?","source_cn":"好啦，年轻人，你们要找我问的“药用植物”是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6840B52D84189CB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1028309009":{"text":"그래, 그래서 물어보려는 “약용 식물”이 어떤 거지?","source_cn":"好啦，年轻人，你们要找我问的“药用植物”是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6840B52D84189CB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028309010:1":{"text":"아아, 이 식물들은 전부 이 근처에서 찾을 수 있어. 채집하고 하루가 지나기 전에 써야 효과가 좋아.","source_cn":"哦，这几种植物大部分都在附近能找到，采摘后一日内，效果最佳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63B84B935D6108FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028309011:1":{"text":"아참, 싱싱한 마력 새싹은 이블 시드에서만 채집할 수 있다는 걸 명심하게. 고놈들 도망치는 게 어찌나 빠른지...","source_cn":"啊对了，你们要记住，新鲜的魔力嫩芽只能在魔花种子上采集...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F363F0F70AB726A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028309012:1":{"text":"그리고 또 하나. 자네들이 찾는 건 다 성분이 복잡한 약재들이라, 아무거나 막 집어 먹으면 안 돼!","source_cn":"还有还有，你们问的那些植物都是药草，药性复杂，可不敢随...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x604699F59419BC3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028309013:1":{"text":"누가 아프면 먼저 의사를 찾아가서 약을 타야...","source_cn":"要是有人生病的话，记得要先去找医师开药方……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50A71D8F3C3583F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028309014:1":{"text":"네! 알겠습니다! 감사해요, 어르신!","source_cn":"知道了！谢谢您，老人家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9F21DFFFC9B8B26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:14:0:1":{"text":"“묘약”에 쓰는 식물이 어디서 자라는지 묻는다","source_cn":"询问“灵药”的植物位置","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x97027E49D0E596A3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"“묘약”에 쓰는 식물이 어디서 자라는지 묻는다","female":"“묘약”에 쓰는 식물이 어디서 자라는지 묻는다","variant_male_record_index":"61746","variant_female_record_index":"61747","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"어때?","source_cn":"怎么样？<key:dialog3>","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x63778B0091313085","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어때?","female":"어때?","variant_male_record_index":"61744","variant_female_record_index":"61745","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:喝茶的老者":{"text":"차를 마시고 있는 노인","source":"喝茶的老者","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":3}}